   'Tom honors U.S. Army 1st Lt. Thomas M. Martin, 27, of Ward, Arkansas, assigned to the 1st Squadron, 40th Cavalry Regiment, 4th Brigade Combat Team (Airborne), 25th Infantry Division, based at Fort Richardson, Alaska. He died on Oct. 14, 2007, in Al Busayifi, Iraq, of wounds suffered when insurgents attacked his unit with small-arms fire.

You have 25 minutes to complete as many rounds as possible of 7 muscle-ups, 11 thrusters (155 lb / 105 lb) and 14 toes-to-bar. Each round is 32 reps. The thrusters are heavy, and the muscle-ups and toes-to-bar both tax your grip and trunk, so steady rounds beat a fast start.',
   '[{"name": "Muscle-Ups", "reps": "7", "tip": "Rings are the usual choice; CrossFit does not specify. Strong kip, then turn over fast."}, {"name": "Thrusters", "reps": "11", "tip": "Front squat below parallel and drive the bar overhead. A heavy load, so plan small sets.", "rx_men": "155 lb", "rx_women": "105 lb"}, {"name": "Toes-to-Bar", "reps": "14", "tip": "Hang, kip and bring your toes to the bar. Short sets save your grip."}]'::jsonb,
   'Score is total rounds + reps.',
